# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
# Development is on Windows; the production company server is expected to be Linux
# (docs/03-network.md). Storing LF avoids CRLF artefacts in shell scripts and config files
# that would break there.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated; collapse in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
